  "notes": "Governmental activities modified cash basis (governmental funds Total column p5); business-type accrual basis (proprietary funds total column p7, measure net position), as FY2023/FY2024. Fund balances roll forward 1,502,918 + 971,263 - 837,207 + 31,431 - 31,431 = 1,636,974. Business-type: 959,866 + 435,485 - 442,690 = 952,661 (no transfers). Proprietary cash flows p8 tie: 73,371 - 95,474 - 98,944 + 248 = -120,799; 414,391 -> 293,592 (= SNP pooled cash 73,674 + cash 212,477 + restricted cash 7,441). Water refinanced 450,000 of debt (proceeds/payments only on the cash flow statement p8; not on the net position roll-forward). Beginning governmental cash not printed (null); ending_cash = unrestricted cash 271,791 + 235,898 + certificates of deposit 158,541 + county treasurer 5,340 (restricted cash and CDs excluded, as FY2023); ending_investments = unrestricted CDs 158,541 (informational, already in ending_cash). Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds statement (p4, totals equal government-wide p1), business-type lines from the Statement of Net Position business-type column (p1); total_* are the Total column. Detail: General, Hospital and Keno budget schedules (Other Governmental Funds column = Hospital + Keno); General Fund 'Proceeds from general long-term debt' actual '-' (budget 400) and Keno 'General government' actual '-' (budget 15,000) not recorded (zero actuals). Permanent Trust Fund has no schedule. Keno Fund 'Miscellaneous' 3,639 categorized keno/lottery from the fund name (user ruling 2026-11-12); the statement's Total-column Miscellaneous 149,119 stays other. Water, Sewer, Golf per-fund lines from the proprietary statement (no utility budget schedules in the trim); nonoperating interest income/expense and bond issuance costs marked outside_printed_total for the per-fund operating totals. Component units (Parkview Lodge, Airport Authority) excluded. Read pages 1-11 of 11"
